("pregnant-1uhijlp","","experienced_mother","second_pregnancy","belief","is_this_normal,body_changes,humour","I always see posts where people ask, “is it my water breaking, or did I just pee myself?” And I always think to myself, how do you not know the difference? Well as of today, I’m here to tell you it’s actually not that simple.","Nearly 37 weeks; leaked on the treadmill and thought her waters had gone."),
