("PregnancyUK-1uhplod","","expecting_mother","second_trimester","tried_failed","heat,purchase,shortage","We’ve been searching online for a portable AC but they’re all gone and I doubt we’ll be able to get one in time.","Portable air conditioners sold out."),
("PregnancyUK-1uhplod","","expecting_mother","second_trimester","fear","heat,fear_for_baby","I know it’s irrational but I’m so scared that this heat will be harming the baby - I know rationally that we’re all in the same boat and lots of women get pregnant in hot countries but the thought still lingers at the back of my mind.","Fear that the heat harms the baby."),
